{{also|Schwänz}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|swanz}}, from {{m|gmh|swanzen||to swing}}, derived from {{m|gmh|swanken}}, whence modern {{cog|de|schwanken||to wobble}}. Compare also {{cog|gml|swansen}}, {{m|gml|swensen|t=to skip, dance, strut, twirl}}. Cognate of {{cog|yi|שװאַנץ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ʃvant͡s/|[ʃʋänts]|/ʃvans/|[ʃʋäns]}}
* {{rhymes|de|ants}}
* {{audio|de|De-Schwanz.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m|Schwanzes|Schwänze|Schwänzchen}}

# A [[tail]].
# {{lb|de|informal|mildly|vulgar}} a [[cock]], a [[penis]].
# {{lb|de|derogatory|of a person}} A [[prick]].
#: {{ux|de|Was will der '''Schwanz''' von mir?|What does this '''prick''' want from me?}}

